<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Employee Management System</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.2.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4f46e5;
            --primary-light: #eef2ff;
            --bg-color: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        /* Navbar */
        nav {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 1rem 5%;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* Header Section */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Container & Cards */
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px 50px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        /* Remix Icon Styling */
        .icon-box {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover .icon-box {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .icon-box i {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin: 10px 0;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">
            <i class="ri-shield-user-line"></i> EmpPortal
        </div>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/form/allEmp">Directory</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <header>
        <h1>Workforce Dashboard</h1>
        <p>Efficiently manage your team, track records, and streamline your HR operations in one place.</p>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <a href="/form/employee" class="card">
            <div class="icon-box">
                <i class="ri-user-add-line"></i>
            </div>
            <h3>Add Employee</h3>
            <p>Onboard a new member by filling out their professional details.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/form/allEmp" class="card">
            <div class="icon-box">
                <i class="ri-team-line"></i>
            </div>
            <h3>Employee List</h3>
            <p>Access the full database to view, search, or modify employee profiles.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/about" class="card">
            <div class="icon-box">
                <i class="ri-information-line"></i>
            </div>
            <h3>Company Info</h3>
            <p>View application version and system documentation details.</p>
        </a>
    </main>

</body>

</html>